{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey there \ud83d\udc4b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm Blu, and this is my <strong>first ever game</strong> \u2014 made with zero game dev experience, just a lot of curiosity and late nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Apartment 22</strong> is a bite-sized horror game where you\u2019re trapped in a time loop inside a strange apartment. You\u2019ll search for clues left behind by someone else\u2026 or maybe by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playthrough is a little different. The more you play, the more you start to uncover what\u2019s really going on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>It won\u2019t take much of your time \u2014 but it just might stick in your head longer than you expect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/extras/90189d816cccdd4b8d212a64aae65e83.poster.avif?t=1751471791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/extras/90189d816cccdd4b8d212a64aae65e83.webm?t=1751471791\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844550?t=1751471791","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844550?t=1751471791","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/3910b2b6286c0fad896d635adbc699bfc8c92814/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751471791","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844550/3910b2b6286c0fad896d635adbc699bfc8c92814/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751471791","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Ster